      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03077",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": " 古歌：“思君与恋君，一切都不说。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "An old poem says: I think of you and long for you, but I say nothing at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03077",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "但将身上衣，染成栀子色。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I only dye the clothes I wear the color of gardenia.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03077",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "见《古今和歌六帖》。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This appears in the Kokin Wakashu Rokujo.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03077",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "栀子花与棣棠花都是黄色的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Gardenia flowers and kerria flowers are both yellow.",
          "g": "predicate"
